# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, the one that keeps its lists in memory: it deletes that
# store and adds src/todo/infrastructure/postgres (the fixed code, the
# application's tables and migrations), the migration job src/todo/migrate.py,
# and alembic.ini. The base files it changes are the composition root, the
# service over the store with its error and scenarios (the repository, and the
# unavailable answer), and the project's build files.
base library/architecture/python/vp-http-api-in-python.skill/examples-proto
change src/todo/main.py
change src/todo/service/item_lists.py
change src/todo/service/errors.py
change src/todo/service/features/item_lists.feature
change src/todo/service/test/item_lists_steps_test.py
change pyproject.toml
change Makefile
change README.md
delete src/todo/infrastructure/memory/*
